WEBVTT

01:38.140 --> 01:41.070
[The Demon Hunter's Romance]

01:41.090 --> 01:43.950
[Episode 22]

01:44.530 --> 01:46.530
Since His Lordship is with us today,

01:46.670 --> 01:49.200
Mr. Duan, why don't you compose another poem?

01:49.600 --> 01:51.130
Yes, don't be so modest!

01:51.150 --> 01:51.789
Give us another!

01:51.789 --> 01:52.910
Give us another!

01:53.380 --> 01:55.580
What's the point of just writing poems?

01:55.759 --> 01:56.729
His Lordship

01:56.759 --> 01:58.289
didn't gather us here today

01:58.350 --> 01:59.640
just to seek talent.

02:01.310 --> 02:03.000
Then tell us, young scholar,

02:03.280 --> 02:04.760
what do you think

02:05.200 --> 02:06.730
this banquet is really for?

02:09.520 --> 02:10.840
Today, His Lordship

02:11.030 --> 02:12.840
gathered us all here at this banquet

02:12.840 --> 02:14.640
to make a statement to the world:

02:14.910 --> 02:16.230
as long as you have the talent,

02:16.230 --> 02:18.030
you can take the imperial examination.

02:18.030 --> 02:19.079
From this day forward,

02:19.079 --> 02:20.710
we'll all be his protégés

02:21.290 --> 02:22.490
and representatives

02:22.560 --> 02:24.290
of scholars of humble origins.

02:24.470 --> 02:25.030
One day,

02:25.360 --> 02:26.760
if we succeed in the exam,

02:26.960 --> 02:28.490
we'll all remember this day

02:28.560 --> 02:30.470
and where we came from.

02:31.030 --> 02:32.150
That makes so much sense.

02:32.150 --> 02:33.210
Well said, indeed!

02:33.840 --> 02:34.590
Well said.

02:35.030 --> 02:36.280
Well said!

02:36.310 --> 02:37.120
Well said!

02:37.970 --> 02:39.430
Jiu, you have great talent

02:39.430 --> 02:40.960
and such remarkable insight.

02:40.960 --> 02:42.420
I'm genuinely impressed.

02:42.750 --> 02:44.680
You and I clicked the moment we met.

02:44.750 --> 02:45.630
From now on,

02:45.930 --> 02:48.640
you're like a brother to me.

02:53.630 --> 02:54.150
Liu,

02:54.680 --> 02:55.430
you've spoken

02:55.430 --> 02:57.160
what I've long felt in my heart.

02:57.870 --> 02:58.910
Meeting all of you

02:59.120 --> 03:00.920
is the greatest honor of my life.

03:01.080 --> 03:02.630
Since we all share the same goal

03:02.630 --> 03:03.830
and the same beliefs,

03:04.680 --> 03:06.120
why don't we swear a blood oath

03:06.120 --> 03:07.650
and become sworn brothers?

03:13.280 --> 03:15.140
Excellent idea. Excellent idea.

03:17.190 --> 03:18.250
Let me borrow this.

03:30.910 --> 03:32.100
After drinking the blood wine,

03:32.100 --> 03:33.170
we'll be family.

03:36.400 --> 03:36.960
Well...

03:41.750 --> 03:42.310
I'm in!

03:54.030 --> 03:54.890
It's your turn.

03:56.960 --> 03:57.490
Alright!

03:58.430 --> 03:59.290
Let's all do it!

03:59.590 --> 04:00.680
Sure, let's do it.

04:08.590 --> 04:09.960
It's all ink.

04:13.560 --> 04:14.470
Raise your cups.

04:14.470 --> 04:15.080
Cheers!

04:15.430 --> 04:16.190
Cheers!

04:16.560 --> 04:17.070
Come on.

04:21.390 --> 04:21.990
Good wine!

04:22.120 --> 04:22.750
Refreshing!

04:22.750 --> 04:23.680
Please, please.

04:24.240 --> 04:25.900
How come there's not even one?

04:26.560 --> 04:27.270
And we made

04:27.270 --> 04:28.310
such a commotion,

04:28.670 --> 04:30.430
but there's no reaction from behind at all.

04:30.430 --> 04:31.690
Something must be off.

04:33.720 --> 04:34.920
You can go take a look.

04:35.360 --> 04:36.890
With this many people? How?

04:38.560 --> 04:39.310
You can do it.

04:42.190 --> 04:43.120
Chancellor Cao,

04:43.750 --> 04:45.070
Mr. Duan would like to perform

04:45.070 --> 04:46.430
a sword dance for everyone.

04:46.430 --> 04:47.690
Would that be alright?

04:49.560 --> 04:51.790
Mr. Duan knows swordplay?

04:56.920 --> 04:57.940
Just a little.

04:58.630 --> 04:59.620
Just a little.

05:00.240 --> 05:00.750
Go on.

05:01.360 --> 05:02.490
Master of the sword.

05:02.750 --> 05:04.310
I-I don't know how…

05:56.350 --> 05:57.750
Lord Xin'an didn't come.

05:57.909 --> 06:00.310
Those scholars are all very disappointed.

06:00.360 --> 06:01.270
It's alright.

06:01.770 --> 06:02.360
Tomorrow, they

06:02.360 --> 06:03.480
will cheer up.

06:06.160 --> 06:07.270
But think about it—

06:07.870 --> 06:09.600
this person painted the Night Banquet at South Lake

06:09.600 --> 06:11.660
but didn't include Lord Xin'an in it.

06:13.430 --> 06:14.070
Right.

06:15.720 --> 06:16.360
Xuanye,

06:17.190 --> 06:19.190
my dad remembers his own name,

06:20.130 --> 06:22.310
so just like us, he didn't lose his memories.

06:22.310 --> 06:23.120
That means

06:23.280 --> 06:24.140
he wouldn't act according to

06:24.140 --> 06:26.600
the role he was given in the painting, right?

06:26.920 --> 06:29.720
You think Lord Xin'an is your dad?

06:35.800 --> 06:38.000
This is the easiest place to stay hidden.

06:38.000 --> 06:38.920
Split up and search.

06:38.920 --> 06:39.510
Yes!

07:07.950 --> 07:09.510
My Lord, over there…

07:33.120 --> 07:36.010
Does what you said yesterday still count?

07:43.430 --> 07:44.430
W-What did I say?

07:47.240 --> 07:49.120
Yesterday, you said you like me.

07:49.630 --> 07:50.190
You don't know

07:50.190 --> 07:51.240
when it started,

07:51.360 --> 07:53.490
but it feels like it's been a long time.

07:55.070 --> 07:56.200
You remember it all?

08:00.240 --> 08:01.160
I thought you'd forget—

08:01.160 --> 08:02.290
that's why I said it.

08:04.560 --> 08:07.420
Whether I remember it or not doesn't really matter.

08:09.480 --> 08:10.410
Then I'll say it.

08:12.310 --> 08:12.950
Yes,

08:13.510 --> 08:15.360
I had many concerns before.

08:16.210 --> 08:17.820
I'm engaged.

08:18.870 --> 08:19.720
But I don't like

08:19.720 --> 08:20.950
that man at all.

08:22.130 --> 08:23.180
Still, I know…

08:23.370 --> 08:24.180
it's not

08:24.270 --> 08:26.170
exactly proper between us.

08:27.390 --> 08:29.720
But after everything we've been through,

08:30.680 --> 08:31.630
I've realized…

08:34.789 --> 08:36.789
I really like you.

08:40.490 --> 08:42.049
So no matter what you say,

08:42.150 --> 08:43.809
I've made up my mind about you.

08:47.390 --> 08:47.920
Let's go!

08:50.480 --> 08:51.510
You don't like me,

08:52.270 --> 08:53.730
and you're fixated on him?

08:54.720 --> 08:55.550
He Quelian!

08:56.480 --> 08:58.130
You've gone too far!

08:58.480 --> 08:59.630
After them!

09:15.540 --> 09:16.740
They didn't catch up.

09:15.720 --> 09:20.290
[Fa'en Temple]

09:18.600 --> 09:19.150
Why don't we

09:19.150 --> 09:20.610
hide in the temple for now?

09:20.790 --> 09:22.150
It's a sacred place.

09:22.270 --> 09:23.900
We'll have the protection of Guanyin Bodhisattva.

09:23.900 --> 09:24.560
I don't believe

09:24.560 --> 09:26.420
Youhuang would dare to kill here.

09:27.790 --> 09:28.320
Let's go.

09:41.510 --> 09:42.570
What are you doing?

09:43.810 --> 09:45.210
I need to test something.

09:46.120 --> 09:47.670
T-Test what?

09:50.570 --> 09:51.500
You don't actually think

09:51.500 --> 09:52.700
this is my mom, do you?

09:53.790 --> 09:55.870
The biggest wonder of the Fair at Flower Festival

09:55.870 --> 09:58.480
is this weeping statue of Guanyin Bodhisattva.

09:58.480 --> 10:00.770
Guanyin Bodhisattva shows compassion and mercy to all beings.

10:00.770 --> 10:02.770
That's what you call a true blessing—

10:02.770 --> 10:04.170
a wonder in its own right.

10:30.260 --> 10:31.150
Mom?

10:36.840 --> 10:38.090
Is that you?

10:47.880 --> 10:49.240
H-How is this possible?

10:53.340 --> 10:55.220
Why is my mom here?

10:55.360 --> 10:56.960
Why has she become like this?

11:02.030 --> 11:02.670
Mom.

11:06.080 --> 11:07.870
Do you remember me?

11:14.120 --> 11:16.070
I'm Banxia.

11:31.360 --> 11:32.360
Mom.

11:36.790 --> 11:38.240
I-I'm Banxia.

11:44.440 --> 11:46.350
What happened to you?

12:05.440 --> 12:05.960
Dad?

12:08.870 --> 12:09.470
Banxia.

12:10.610 --> 12:12.210
Are you sure this is your dad?

12:23.790 --> 12:24.480
Dad.

12:27.150 --> 12:27.870
Dad.

12:31.600 --> 12:32.200
Dad.

12:36.480 --> 12:38.010
Dad, what's wrong with you?

12:40.440 --> 12:41.670
It's me.

12:43.600 --> 12:44.670
It's me.

12:45.360 --> 12:46.080
I'm Banxia.

12:59.840 --> 13:01.560
It's me, Banxia.

13:07.480 --> 13:08.740
What's wrong with you?

13:09.720 --> 13:10.510
You...

13:16.000 --> 13:18.550
Dad, what happened to you?

13:28.600 --> 13:29.360
Dad.

13:42.430 --> 13:44.230
Big Brother, did that fall hurt?

13:44.790 --> 13:45.590
Get up, get up.

13:46.840 --> 13:48.300
Big Brother, Big Brother!

13:48.480 --> 13:49.210
Big Brother!

13:51.100 --> 13:51.830
Big Brother!

13:52.360 --> 13:53.360
Where is he going?

14:14.320 --> 14:16.280
Hit!

14:16.800 --> 14:17.280
Hit.

14:18.000 --> 14:18.510
Hit.

14:18.570 --> 14:20.270
First, I'll gouge out your eyes.

14:20.270 --> 14:22.290
Then, I'll cut off your nose and mouth.

14:22.290 --> 14:24.170
Finally, I'll chop off your head.

14:31.270 --> 14:32.430
I'll chop off…

14:33.030 --> 14:34.360
your head.

14:58.420 --> 14:59.480
How did you get out?

15:06.790 --> 15:08.510
This is outrageous.

15:22.030 --> 15:26.120
All of you, go to hell!

15:42.720 --> 15:43.360
Banxia.

15:45.060 --> 15:46.850
Why can't my dad see,

15:47.030 --> 15:48.870
hear, or speak?

15:50.720 --> 15:52.650
His three senses have been sealed.

15:52.670 --> 15:55.400
He's completely shut off from the outside world.

15:56.910 --> 15:59.040
Was it that demon?

16:00.550 --> 16:02.210
I've been wondering the same.

16:02.600 --> 16:03.730
Why wasn't it enough

16:03.750 --> 16:04.200
for that demon

16:04.200 --> 16:05.440
to capture your mom?

16:05.910 --> 16:07.840
Why did he have to take your dad too?

16:08.750 --> 16:09.960
Now I understand.

16:10.670 --> 16:12.270
It's for the weeping effect.

16:13.000 --> 16:14.330
He placed your mom here,

16:14.840 --> 16:17.080
but a Guanyin Bodhisattva statue that doesn't weep

16:17.080 --> 16:18.740
can't be considered a wonder.

16:23.550 --> 16:25.790
He really went to great lengths.

16:35.480 --> 16:36.240
Dad.

16:37.480 --> 16:39.120
I will definitely get you and Mom

16:39.120 --> 16:39.960
out of here.

16:49.870 --> 16:50.840
Wait for me.

17:14.349 --> 17:15.550
Don't worry too much.

17:16.280 --> 17:17.440
Your dad's senses are only

17:17.440 --> 17:19.480
temporarily sealed by a demonic spell.

17:19.480 --> 17:21.810
Once he's out of this place, he'll be fine.

17:22.440 --> 17:22.920
Hurry!

17:24.109 --> 17:24.640
Let's go.

17:25.349 --> 17:26.240
Constable Liu.

17:26.430 --> 17:27.319
Constable Liu!

17:29.550 --> 17:30.230
Mrs. Huang?

17:30.720 --> 17:32.120
Why have you followed us here?

17:32.120 --> 17:33.160
What's wrong?

17:33.400 --> 17:35.530
Chief is at the government office now.

17:36.550 --> 17:38.070
Please don't be upset.

17:38.680 --> 17:40.880
He's not backing out of the engagement.

17:41.110 --> 17:42.310
A criminal picked today,

17:42.310 --> 17:44.200
of all days, to break out of prison.

17:44.200 --> 17:45.240
Chief had no choice

17:45.240 --> 17:46.560
but to postpone the wedding

17:46.560 --> 17:48.290
and lead the team to arrest him.

17:48.610 --> 17:49.520
Have there been

17:49.550 --> 17:51.010
any prison breaks before?

17:52.270 --> 17:54.400
The world in the painting has changed.

17:55.340 --> 17:56.340
Who escaped?

17:56.750 --> 17:57.680
A desert bandit.

17:58.440 --> 17:59.700
What does he look like?

18:00.440 --> 18:02.070
He's in his fifties, with a face full of wrinkles.

18:02.070 --> 18:02.880
Not very tall,

18:03.160 --> 18:04.560
but extremely ruthless.

18:05.480 --> 18:07.920
It's the demon from the Enlightenment Bookstore.

18:07.920 --> 18:09.080
Where is he now?

18:09.950 --> 18:11.810
It's said he went to the west of the city.

18:11.810 --> 18:12.440
Mrs. Huang,

18:12.440 --> 18:13.480
we'll be going now.

18:13.480 --> 18:14.010
Let's go.

18:16.440 --> 18:16.970
Let's go.

18:21.510 --> 18:22.240
This man

18:22.830 --> 18:25.030
is a desert bandit from Hukou Fortress.

18:25.590 --> 18:27.160
He's highly skilled in martial arts

18:27.160 --> 18:28.490
and extremely vicious.

18:28.920 --> 18:30.850
He's taken more than a dozen lives.

18:31.960 --> 18:32.880
Just earlier,

18:33.480 --> 18:34.830
he broke out of prison

18:35.400 --> 18:37.480
and killed several of our men.

18:37.960 --> 18:38.590
So,

18:38.990 --> 18:41.190
we must capture him as soon as possible!

18:41.400 --> 18:42.640
Has everyone seen his face clearly?

18:42.640 --> 18:43.680
Yes!

18:44.560 --> 18:45.720
Aren't we heading west?

18:45.720 --> 18:46.580
Why are we here?

18:46.590 --> 18:47.400
That's far from here.

18:47.400 --> 18:49.000
Let's steal a horse. Come on.

18:55.000 --> 18:55.590
Quelian?

18:59.600 --> 19:00.730
Quelian, I'm sorry.

19:00.790 --> 19:01.640
We may have to

19:02.050 --> 19:02.930
postpone our wedding.

19:02.930 --> 19:03.730
It's alright.

19:03.960 --> 19:04.760
I understand.

19:04.960 --> 19:06.960
Catching the criminal comes first.

19:09.510 --> 19:10.240
Who is this?

19:12.000 --> 19:13.000
M-My friend.

19:13.960 --> 19:14.510
My Lord!

19:17.000 --> 19:17.550
My Lord.

19:18.030 --> 19:18.510
The patrol guards

19:18.510 --> 19:19.590
spotted the fugitive on Nanshun Street.

19:19.590 --> 19:20.990
They've surrounded him.

19:21.480 --> 19:22.640
Nanshun Street!

19:22.880 --> 19:23.510
Yes!

19:24.400 --> 19:25.030
Move out!

19:29.530 --> 19:31.360
They took off with my horse.

19:32.640 --> 19:34.100
What am I supposed to ride?

19:51.270 --> 19:52.530
This is his territory.

19:52.550 --> 19:54.010
We'll play it by ear later.

19:54.550 --> 19:54.970
Got it.

19:59.320 --> 20:00.490
It's you?

20:00.720 --> 20:02.160
It's your head that I want!

20:02.160 --> 20:03.560
Come and get it if you can!

20:35.550 --> 20:36.830
He's not stronger than me,

20:36.830 --> 20:38.090
and not faster either.

20:38.160 --> 20:38.680
He's not

20:38.680 --> 20:39.830
as powerful as you said.

20:39.830 --> 20:41.400
Seems like his abilities are limited

20:41.400 --> 20:43.450
inside the painting, just like mine.

20:43.450 --> 20:44.490
Darn it!

20:45.030 --> 20:46.320
Why are you this strong?

20:46.320 --> 20:47.480
This is outrageous.

20:47.640 --> 20:48.750
Outrageous!

21:02.960 --> 21:03.550
Banxia.

21:22.400 --> 21:23.490
This is outrageous!

21:23.490 --> 21:24.780
Just you wait!

21:29.380 --> 21:30.060
Make way!

21:30.160 --> 21:31.090
Move aside! Move aside!

21:31.090 --> 21:32.090
Step aside! Move!

21:34.590 --> 21:36.210
Leave a few behind to help the wounded.

21:36.210 --> 21:37.200
Everyone else, after them!

21:37.200 --> 21:37.720
Yes!

21:37.750 --> 21:38.240
Yes!

21:43.240 --> 21:45.400
That looks like the direction of the Underground City.

21:45.400 --> 21:46.320
That should be

21:46.350 --> 21:47.880
his exit from the painting.

22:01.830 --> 22:02.960
You're hot on my heels.

22:02.960 --> 22:03.640
Demon,

22:03.780 --> 22:04.720
you dragged my parents

22:04.720 --> 22:05.350
into this!

22:05.400 --> 22:06.310
I'll kill you!

23:02.960 --> 23:04.420
How dare you sneak up on me?

23:22.680 --> 23:23.160
Banxia.

23:30.400 --> 23:31.750
Just you wait!

23:39.270 --> 23:39.830
Banxia.

23:40.510 --> 23:41.070
Banxia!

23:43.680 --> 23:44.510
Just you wait.

23:46.210 --> 23:47.590
I'll chop off your limbs first,

23:47.590 --> 23:49.030
then break your spine,

23:49.050 --> 23:50.710
and finally cut off your head!

23:51.000 --> 23:52.260
This is outrageous. Outrageous!

23:52.260 --> 23:53.150
No, no, no.

23:53.270 --> 23:55.040
I'll break your spine first,

23:55.070 --> 23:56.680
then chop off your limbs,

23:56.680 --> 23:58.880
and finally cut off your head!

24:02.270 --> 24:03.400
This is outrageous.

24:06.400 --> 24:07.000
Youhuang!

24:07.110 --> 24:08.910
Find a physician to save Banxia!

24:10.070 --> 24:10.720
Quelian.

24:10.750 --> 24:11.280
Banxia.

24:12.110 --> 24:13.240
-Banxia.
-Quelian!

24:13.350 --> 24:15.000
Quelian, what's wrong with you?

24:15.000 --> 24:17.110
Zhao Sheng, go get help!

24:18.110 --> 24:18.720
Quelian.

24:21.720 --> 24:22.780
Don't fall asleep!

24:22.790 --> 24:24.640
Hang in there. Stop him!

24:24.720 --> 24:25.240
Yes.

24:26.590 --> 24:27.200
Banxia.

24:45.590 --> 24:46.590
Quelian.

24:56.430 --> 24:57.760
Who's locked up in here?

24:57.790 --> 24:58.720
What did he do?

24:59.270 --> 24:59.880
Lord Huang's bride

24:59.880 --> 25:00.820
died.

25:01.160 --> 25:02.610
He was right there when it happened.

25:02.610 --> 25:03.720
No one knows who he is,

25:03.720 --> 25:05.650
and he won't answer any questions.

25:05.720 --> 25:06.920
Once Lord Huang recovers from the shock,

25:06.920 --> 25:08.780
he'll probably interrogate him.

25:34.060 --> 25:34.680
Big Brother, did that fall hurt?

25:34.680 --> 25:36.140
Lift your foot! Your foot!

25:36.640 --> 25:38.830
Big... Big Brother.

25:39.000 --> 25:41.510
Big Brother.

25:43.210 --> 25:45.880
Big Brother! Big Brother!

25:45.900 --> 25:46.900
Damao.

25:47.510 --> 25:48.790
Ermao, Sanmao.

25:49.640 --> 25:50.030
Simao.

25:50.030 --> 25:51.490
What are you washing here?

25:55.330 --> 25:56.240
Damao. Damao.

26:01.160 --> 26:01.890
Big Brother!

26:02.000 --> 26:02.730
Big Brother!

26:04.000 --> 26:04.730
Big Brother!

26:05.310 --> 26:06.510
Where's Big Brother?

26:08.070 --> 26:09.530
Big Brother is lost again.

26:10.110 --> 26:11.970
Go check the martial arts school.

26:15.440 --> 26:16.110
Master He.

26:16.720 --> 26:17.400
Master He, congratulations!

26:17.400 --> 26:18.000
Banxia.

26:18.000 --> 26:19.200
Thank you, thank you.

26:19.200 --> 26:19.660
Banxia.

26:20.720 --> 26:21.880
-Banxia.
-Who's that?

26:21.880 --> 26:22.540
Who are you?

26:24.550 --> 26:25.110
Banxia.

26:25.590 --> 26:26.110
Banxia!

26:26.160 --> 26:27.420
Why is he shouting like a lunatic?

26:27.420 --> 26:28.220
Throw him out!

26:28.720 --> 26:29.310
Stop him!

26:29.820 --> 26:31.140
Banxia! Let me go!

26:31.400 --> 26:33.160
Banxia!

26:36.240 --> 26:36.750
Banxia!

26:38.350 --> 26:40.110
Banxia!

26:41.030 --> 26:41.720
Banxia!

26:42.860 --> 26:43.580
Banxia!

26:46.200 --> 26:47.550
Who is that?

27:04.950 --> 27:06.010
You asked for this.

27:11.830 --> 27:13.920
My Lady, do you know him?

27:18.680 --> 27:19.840
The auspicious hour is approaching.

27:19.840 --> 27:21.310
You need to hurry!

27:25.160 --> 27:28.000
Stop! Stop!

27:28.480 --> 27:29.020
Big Brother.

27:29.020 --> 27:30.440
Are you alright, Big Brother?

27:30.440 --> 27:31.170
Big Brother.

27:32.720 --> 27:33.200
Guys,

27:33.480 --> 27:35.350
he hit his head this morning

27:36.460 --> 27:38.110
and suddenly lost his senses.

27:38.110 --> 27:39.110
I apologize to you

27:39.160 --> 27:40.830
on behalf of him.

27:41.240 --> 27:42.000
Sorry.

27:43.590 --> 27:44.250
Seriously,

27:44.720 --> 27:46.180
what's wrong with you people?

27:46.180 --> 27:48.480
He's lost his mind, and you still let him out?

27:48.480 --> 27:50.030
We didn't keep an eye on him.

27:50.210 --> 27:51.070
-It's our fault.
-Master He.

27:51.070 --> 27:52.130
Please forgive him

27:52.440 --> 27:53.770
and don't take offense.

27:55.000 --> 27:56.480
Master…

27:58.070 --> 27:59.680
It's a joyous occasion today.

27:59.680 --> 28:01.210
I won't hold it against you.

28:01.400 --> 28:02.070
Get out of here now.

28:02.070 --> 28:02.790
Thank you, Master He.

28:02.790 --> 28:03.990
Thank you, Master He.

28:04.880 --> 28:06.340
Big Brother. Big Brother!

28:16.960 --> 28:18.680
What's wrong with Big Brother?

28:18.680 --> 28:20.070
Has he really gone mad?

28:20.830 --> 28:21.880
I-I don't know.

28:22.110 --> 28:23.640
He's never been

28:23.960 --> 28:24.960
like this before.

28:25.160 --> 28:26.040
He's wandering

28:26.070 --> 28:27.090
in circles in the field.

28:27.090 --> 28:28.020
What is he doing?

28:28.840 --> 28:29.770
If he's gone mad,

28:29.790 --> 28:31.190
that's a serious matter.

28:39.680 --> 28:41.350
Wasn't there a river here before?

28:41.350 --> 28:43.350
You could take a boat straight to the Underground City.

28:43.350 --> 28:44.550
Why is the river gone?

28:45.240 --> 28:47.500
Big Brother, what are you talking about?

28:49.750 --> 28:50.720
Don't you know

28:51.400 --> 28:53.060
there was a river here before?

28:55.590 --> 28:57.920
I've never heard anything like that.

28:58.200 --> 29:00.400
And I've certainly never heard of an Underground City.

29:00.400 --> 29:01.720
N-Neither have I.

29:01.720 --> 29:02.790
Never.

29:17.750 --> 29:19.350
Surprised, aren't you?

29:19.370 --> 29:20.960
Everything drawn with a brush

29:20.960 --> 29:23.000
can be erased by a brush.

29:24.350 --> 29:27.310
The vanishing of the Underground City is just the beginning.

29:27.310 --> 29:28.680
You want to play?

29:29.030 --> 29:30.200
Where's the ink? Where's the ink?

29:30.200 --> 29:31.200
I need a lot of ink!

29:36.200 --> 29:39.000
You'll get to play as long as you want.

29:45.480 --> 29:48.830
A lot of ink, a lot of ink.

29:49.960 --> 29:52.720
A lot of ink, a lot of ink!

29:54.090 --> 29:55.370
These clothes

29:55.400 --> 29:56.690
are our work uniforms.

29:56.720 --> 29:58.180
Can't you be more careful?

29:59.270 --> 30:00.590
You just pricked me.

30:00.750 --> 30:01.910
Stop whining.

30:04.680 --> 30:05.210
Brother,

30:06.110 --> 30:06.770
I'm hungry.

30:08.460 --> 30:09.640
Fourth Brother has been gone for ages.

30:09.640 --> 30:10.910
Why isn't he back yet?

30:16.510 --> 30:17.110
The money.

30:17.480 --> 30:18.200
The money.

30:21.750 --> 30:22.280
Brother,

30:22.680 --> 30:24.560
i-it's getting dark.

30:24.590 --> 30:27.590
A-Aren't you hungry? Don't you want to eat something?

30:28.880 --> 30:29.750
Come back.

30:29.750 --> 30:31.550
Give me the buns. Give them to me.

30:39.510 --> 30:41.770
No matter how fast you run, it's useless.

30:45.450 --> 30:47.600
Can you outrun that paintbrush?

30:56.160 --> 30:57.360
What did you just say?

30:57.930 --> 30:58.750
I said no matter how fast you are,

30:58.750 --> 31:00.680
you can't outrun that paintbrush.

31:04.200 --> 31:06.400
You shouldn't have gone to that bride either.

31:06.400 --> 31:07.440
How did you know?

31:08.890 --> 31:09.810
Who are you?

31:10.260 --> 31:11.490
I'm someone who escaped

31:11.490 --> 31:13.290
the Night Banquet at South Lake,

31:13.350 --> 31:15.550
someone who ran away from his own story.

31:25.000 --> 31:26.130
You are Lord Xin'an?

31:28.960 --> 31:30.420
You've been to South Lake.

31:32.400 --> 31:33.510
Why are you here?

31:35.200 --> 31:36.200
Isn't it obvious?

31:36.440 --> 31:38.170
It's lively here during the day

31:38.270 --> 31:39.440
and quiet at night.

31:40.310 --> 31:42.040
Perfect for drinking in peace.

31:42.200 --> 31:43.160
I'm asking

31:43.590 --> 31:45.390
why you're inside the painting.

31:45.880 --> 31:46.590
Young man,

31:47.400 --> 31:48.680
what year is it now?

31:51.720 --> 31:53.580
The 8th year of the Tianxiang Era.

31:57.000 --> 31:58.480
It's only been two years.

32:01.030 --> 32:02.030
But it feels like

32:03.130 --> 32:04.960
hundreds of years have passed.

32:07.750 --> 32:08.680
Two years ago,

32:09.160 --> 32:10.690
I got a blood-borne disease

32:10.830 --> 32:13.760
and searched far and wide for a cure, but I found none.

32:14.590 --> 32:16.200
In the face of birth, aging, sickness, and death,

32:16.200 --> 32:17.920
whether you're royalty

32:18.030 --> 32:19.240
or a commoner,

32:19.640 --> 32:21.030
everyone is the same.

32:22.470 --> 32:23.810
Back then, someone told me

32:23.810 --> 32:25.470
that in the Underground City,

32:25.960 --> 32:28.360
there was a Living Healer named Huangfu Bai

32:28.720 --> 32:30.720
who had miraculous healing skills.

32:31.400 --> 32:32.270
I believed it

32:33.590 --> 32:35.250
and came here with my servant.

32:36.400 --> 32:38.000
You came seeking treatment?

32:40.070 --> 32:41.800
Unfortunately, I was too late.

32:42.000 --> 32:44.400
He said my condition was already terminal.

32:45.400 --> 32:47.330
That there was nothing he could do.

32:48.130 --> 32:49.270
Feeling frustrated,

32:49.270 --> 32:51.530
I wandered around the Underground City.

32:53.830 --> 32:56.090
Surprisingly, I found a glimmer of hope.

32:57.120 --> 32:59.410
I came across the Enlightenment Bookstore.

32:59.410 --> 33:00.830
The storekeeper there, Sha,

33:00.830 --> 33:01.960
listened to my story

33:03.640 --> 33:05.550
and told me he had a way to save me.

33:05.920 --> 33:07.160
He said there was

33:07.180 --> 33:09.510
an incredibly beautiful place in the world.

33:09.510 --> 33:11.040
If I could enter that place,

33:11.240 --> 33:12.720
I'd still be royalty,

33:13.480 --> 33:15.080
and my illness would be gone.

33:16.960 --> 33:18.020
Most importantly,

33:18.730 --> 33:20.120
I'd live forever.

33:22.960 --> 33:23.960
You believed him?

33:24.550 --> 33:25.400
Of course.

33:27.550 --> 33:29.030
You wouldn't understand

33:30.330 --> 33:31.160
what it's like to be someone

33:31.160 --> 33:32.960
clinging to life with no hope.

33:33.600 --> 33:34.460
In those years,

33:34.720 --> 33:35.640
I believed things far more

33:35.640 --> 33:36.550
absurd than that.

33:36.550 --> 33:38.270
Besides, what he said

33:39.200 --> 33:40.530
wasn't entirely false.

33:41.130 --> 33:42.540
So I stayed,

33:43.160 --> 33:44.490
had my memories erased,

33:44.720 --> 33:46.790
and spent every day in endless joy.

33:49.520 --> 33:51.000
If I hadn't woken up,

33:51.510 --> 33:52.270
perhaps

33:53.440 --> 33:54.030
I would have

33:54.030 --> 33:55.560
lived on like that forever.

33:56.450 --> 33:57.600
How did you wake up?

33:58.070 --> 33:59.070
I don't remember.

34:01.680 --> 34:02.510
All I know is, one day,

34:02.510 --> 34:03.720
I painted a picture—

34:05.030 --> 34:06.230
an autumn moon scene.

34:08.030 --> 34:09.360
And suddenly, I woke up.

34:10.400 --> 34:11.230
I showed this painting

34:11.230 --> 34:12.320
to my old servant,

34:13.880 --> 34:15.030
and he woke up too.

34:16.920 --> 34:18.250
Where's that painting?

34:18.550 --> 34:19.199
It's gone.

34:20.400 --> 34:21.320
I burned it.

34:22.070 --> 34:23.130
Why did you burn it?

34:23.550 --> 34:25.280
Because my servant died.

34:27.550 --> 34:28.810
You don't understand.

34:30.030 --> 34:31.090
Once you're awake,

34:31.480 --> 34:34.139
if you refuse the arrangements in the painting,

34:34.760 --> 34:35.920
you'll die.

34:36.469 --> 34:38.000
Everything in this painted world

34:38.000 --> 34:39.670
has been given new meaning.

34:40.290 --> 34:41.710
Anyone who refuses to accept

34:41.710 --> 34:43.630
the rules of this world,

34:43.960 --> 34:46.000
denies their assigned role,

34:46.350 --> 34:47.210
or refuses to believe

34:47.210 --> 34:48.940
in the reality of this place

34:50.150 --> 34:51.730
will be slowly erased.

34:53.590 --> 34:54.630
And this erasure

34:55.880 --> 34:57.940
is to make you completely disappear.

35:09.510 --> 35:10.400
You'll turn…

35:12.710 --> 35:14.800
transparent like glass

35:15.230 --> 35:16.690
until you no longer exist.

35:25.960 --> 35:26.590
What?

35:27.840 --> 35:28.970
You believed it too?

35:30.360 --> 35:31.290
Do you regret it?

35:31.740 --> 35:32.490
Regret?

35:34.000 --> 35:35.230
Regret coming here?

35:38.760 --> 35:40.160
What's the use of regret?

35:41.590 --> 35:42.880
It was my own choice.

35:44.550 --> 35:46.410
But being trapped here day by day…

35:47.670 --> 35:49.270
it doesn't feel like living.

35:51.330 --> 35:53.020
It'd be easier to just vanish.

35:55.510 --> 35:57.910
The Underground City used to be the way out.

35:57.960 --> 35:59.130
It's gone now,

35:59.710 --> 36:01.000
but there must be another way out.

36:01.000 --> 36:01.760
There isn't.

36:02.590 --> 36:03.920
I've tried everything.

36:05.280 --> 36:06.880
Everything in this painting

36:07.230 --> 36:08.430
is under his control—

36:09.260 --> 36:11.340
the sun, moon, stars, heaven and earth…

36:11.340 --> 36:12.250
even you and me!

36:13.880 --> 36:15.740
If he's such a brilliant painter,

36:15.960 --> 36:17.630
why can't he paint a moon?

36:35.410 --> 36:38.060
[Missing]

36:38.920 --> 36:39.630
Excuse me,

36:39.710 --> 36:41.170
have you seen this person?

36:42.230 --> 36:42.840
No.

36:44.670 --> 36:45.330
Take a look.

36:48.510 --> 36:49.320
I'll take this one.

36:49.320 --> 36:50.230
The glaze color is nice.

36:50.230 --> 36:50.710
Take a look.

36:50.710 --> 36:51.150
Look.

36:54.610 --> 36:55.650
What's wrong

36:55.880 --> 36:57.110
w-with Big Brother?

36:58.280 --> 36:59.250
I don't know.

36:59.280 --> 37:00.760
Did he hit his head or something?

37:00.760 --> 37:02.110
He can't drink like this.

37:02.110 --> 37:04.360
He's downed several bottles in just a short while.

37:04.360 --> 37:05.090
Big Brother,

37:05.880 --> 37:06.750
you don't…

37:07.480 --> 37:08.810
want to go to work today?

37:10.890 --> 37:11.670
If Big Brother's not going,

37:11.670 --> 37:12.400
t-then I...

37:12.420 --> 37:13.210
I-I...

37:13.670 --> 37:15.190
I-I won't go either.

37:15.400 --> 37:17.130
What does it have to do with you?

37:18.080 --> 37:19.450
If you really

37:19.480 --> 37:21.140
don't want to go to work today,

37:21.310 --> 37:22.540
then take a day off.

37:23.720 --> 37:25.370
We're going to work.

37:27.840 --> 37:29.040
I-I'm not...

37:29.070 --> 37:30.380
If Big Brother's not going, I…

37:30.380 --> 37:30.800
I-I...

37:30.800 --> 37:31.510
Go to work!

37:31.710 --> 37:32.510
Go to work!

37:32.510 --> 37:33.970
Brother, let me take a sip.

37:34.110 --> 37:35.430
I'm a bit thirsty.

37:35.920 --> 37:36.450
Brother.

37:36.630 --> 37:37.560
Save some for me.

37:41.590 --> 37:42.670
Let's go, let's go.

37:45.070 --> 37:46.840
-Congratulations.
-Thank you.

37:46.840 --> 37:48.440
You must come, you must come.

37:48.550 --> 37:49.440
Thank you all.

37:50.760 --> 37:51.960
Thank you, thank you.

37:52.320 --> 37:53.320
Thank you.

37:53.730 --> 37:54.520
Thank you.

38:09.510 --> 38:10.240
Big Brother.

38:10.710 --> 38:12.030
Big Brother, Big Brother.

38:12.030 --> 38:12.880
Move aside.

38:13.800 --> 38:15.070
Big Brother, haven't you eaten all day?

38:15.070 --> 38:15.590
Move aside!

38:15.590 --> 38:17.250
You've been drinking all day?

38:18.280 --> 38:18.800
Wine.

38:19.200 --> 38:20.070
Go buy me more wine!

38:20.070 --> 38:21.130
Alright, alright.

38:21.130 --> 38:22.340
Big Brother, sit down for a while.

38:22.340 --> 38:23.180
Sit down.

38:25.400 --> 38:26.800
Third Brother, go buy it.

38:28.200 --> 38:29.400
Don't you have any sense?

38:29.400 --> 38:31.060
You're holding all the money.

38:31.190 --> 38:33.760
Get Big Brother something to eat while you're at it.

38:33.760 --> 38:34.490
Big Brother.

38:34.630 --> 38:35.550
What do you want to eat?

38:35.550 --> 38:36.800
Noodles or flatbread?

38:36.800 --> 38:37.510
Lamb lungs.

38:38.150 --> 38:39.280
Buy some lamb lungs.

38:39.960 --> 38:41.110
I want to drink lamb lung soup!

38:41.110 --> 38:41.800
Alright.

38:43.170 --> 38:45.700
Big Brother, you must be tired from drinking.

38:45.800 --> 38:47.480
Here go the lamp lungs.

38:51.320 --> 38:51.960
Okay.

38:54.880 --> 38:56.720
Where are your manners?

38:58.880 --> 38:59.480
Take a sip.

39:02.070 --> 39:02.800
Big Brother.

39:02.880 --> 39:05.630
This soup is too gamey and fishy to drink.

39:06.030 --> 39:08.320
A-Add some of this.

39:09.780 --> 39:11.220
-And some green onions.
-Is it ready?

39:11.220 --> 39:12.030
Just a sec.

39:12.050 --> 39:12.560
Almost done.

39:12.560 --> 39:13.140
More green onions.

39:13.140 --> 39:13.940
Green onions!

40:01.360 --> 40:02.690
A lot of ink, a lot of ink.

40:02.710 --> 40:04.760
A lot of ink, a lot of ink.

40:19.800 --> 40:21.010
Sir, two pancakes, please.

40:21.010 --> 40:22.940
Okay, these two are freshly baked.

40:22.990 --> 40:24.030
I'll wrap them up for you.

40:24.030 --> 40:24.760
Are they hot?

40:25.000 --> 40:25.730
Here you are.

40:38.760 --> 40:39.360
Sir.

40:39.840 --> 40:40.750
Two pancakes, please.

40:40.750 --> 40:41.630
Okay.

40:43.720 --> 40:44.470
Here you go.

40:44.630 --> 40:45.160
Alright.

40:45.360 --> 40:45.840
Take care.

40:45.840 --> 40:46.190
Okay.

40:47.160 --> 40:48.120
It's done!

40:52.460 --> 40:53.250
Where is he?

40:55.360 --> 40:57.040
You brat, here you are.

40:57.070 --> 40:59.360
Sorry to keep you waiting.

40:59.480 --> 41:01.400
I, Sha Man,

41:02.110 --> 41:03.110
am coming for you!

41:10.910 --> 41:12.020
What's going on?

41:12.650 --> 41:13.340
Run!

41:36.630 --> 41:39.510
Brat, you're quite agile.

41:39.860 --> 41:41.790
Let's see how you can survive this.

42:19.850 --> 42:20.730
Go get him!

42:25.700 --> 42:26.640
Run!

42:29.800 --> 42:30.680
Out of the way!

42:31.590 --> 42:32.470
Out of the way!

42:32.550 --> 42:33.440
Out of the way!

42:34.630 --> 42:35.440
Out of the way!
